        "><div><h1 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-text-ink-common-inv-01 !tw-leading-md tw-font-display-sm md:tw-font-display-md" data-heading-level="1">TMX Australia Exchange Warrants</h1><p class="tw-text-ink-common-inv-01">Flexible access to leveraged exposure across a range of asset classes.</p></div></div></section><div data-jumpnav="true" class="tw-sticky tw-top-spacing-000 tw-z-20 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-center tw-bg-interface-brand-teal sm:tw-flex-row"><button class="tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-gap-1 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-text-center tw-font-medium tw-ring-offset-interface-common-base-01 tw-transition-colors tw-font-detail-lg disabled:tw-pointer-events-none focus-visible:tw-outline-none tw-border-interface-brand-teal tw-bg-interface-brand-teal tw-text-[#000000] active:tw-border-[#53C8D1] active:tw-bg-[#53C8D1] disabled:tw-border-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-text-[#529BB0] hover:tw-border-[#79D4DB] hover:tw-bg-[#79D4DB] tw-h-10 tw-border-200 tw-p-spacing-400 tw-relative tw-z-10 tw-flex tw-w-full tw-rounded-none tw-py-spacing-400 sm:tw-hidden">Jump to a Section<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="tw-relative"><ul class="tw-absolute tw-top-spacing-000 tw-z-0 -tw-mt-spacing-500 tw-w-full tw-gap-spacing-100 tw-rounded-md tw-bg-interface-common-base-01 tw-fill-ink-common-inv-01 tw-p-spacing-500 tw-drop-shadow-md tw-filter md:tw-gap-spacing-300 sm:tw-relative sm:tw-mt-spacing-000 sm:tw-flex sm:tw-w-max sm:tw-rounded-xl sm:tw-bg-interface-brand-teal sm:tw-p-[12px] sm:tw-drop-shadow-none tw-hidden"><li class="tw-py-spacing-400 sm:tw-rounded-xl sm:tw-py-spacing-000"><a class="tw-rounded-full tw-px-spacing-400 tw-py-spacing-300 tw-text-ink-brand-deep-blue tw-transition-colors tw-duratio