ide investors an alternative way to invest in a variety of tradable assets and the opportunity to access higher growth or reduce exposure to any one particular asset or risk. Warrants derive their value from an underlying asset such as a security, index, commodity, currency or interest rate. Certain warrants offer investors the option to buy or sell the underlying assets at a predetermined price. Alternatively, other warrants offer cash payments that reflect the price of the underlying asset at a particular time.</p><p>Warrants can provide diversification to a portfolio or offer leveraged exposure to an underlying asset. There are varying styles of warrants and ways in which they can be used, depending on investors&#x27; risk appetite, personal circumstances and investment objectives.</p><p class="!tw-mb-spacing-700">As of 30 April 2026, TMX Australia Exchange offers over<!-- --> <span class="tw-font-bold">1,200 uniquely quoted warrants</span>, covering equities from Australia&#x27;s largest companies, indices, currencies, commodities and fixed income.</p><div class="
            tw-grid tw-gap-spacing-600
            [grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(18rem,1fr))]
          "><div class="tw-relative tw-gap-spacing-200 tw-rounded-md tw-border-100 tw-p-spacing-600 tw-border-interface-brand-teal tw-bg-interface-common-base-01 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;svg]:tw-text-ink-common-base-04 tw-flex tw-grid-cols-1 tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-order-2 tw-mb-spacing-500 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-gap-spacing-200"><h2 class="tw-mb-0 tw-font-subheading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary">Warrants List</h2></div><div class="tw-order-3 tw-mb-spacing-500 tw-font-body-md tw-text-ink-common-base-04 tw-flex-1"><p class="tw-mb-spacing-000">View the current list of warrants available on TMX Australia Exchange.</p></div><div class="tw-order-last tw-flex tw-items-center tw-gap-spacing-400 tw-mt-auto"><a class="tw-inline-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-gap-1 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-text-center tw-font-medium tw-ring-offset-interface-common-base-01 tw-transition-colors tw-font-detail-lg disabled:tw-pointer-events-none focus-visible:tw-outline-none tw-border-[#006B86] tw-text-[#006B86] active:tw-bg-[#B3E7EB] disabled:tw-border-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-text-[#529BB0] hover:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] tw-h-10 tw-rounded-full tw-border-200 tw-p-spacing-400" href="/equities/support/reference-data">View the List</a></div></div><div class="tw-relative tw-gap-spacing-200 tw-rounded-md tw-border-100 tw-p-spacing-600 tw-border-interface-brand-teal tw-bg-interface-common-base-01 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;svg]:tw-text-ink-common-base-04 tw-flex tw-grid-cols-1 tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-order-2 tw-mb-spacing-500 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-gap-spacing-200"><h2 class="tw-mb-0 tw-font-subheading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary">Pricing</h2></div><div class="tw-order-3 tw-mb-spacing-500 tw-font-body-md tw-text-ink-common-base-04 tw-flex-1"><p class="tw-mb-spacing-000">The price of the warrant will change as the price of the underlying fluctuates.</p></div><div class="tw-order-last tw-flex tw-items-center tw-gap-spacing-400 tw-mt-auto"><a class="tw-inline-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-gap-1 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-text-center tw-font-medium tw-ring-offset-interface-common-base-01 tw-transition-colors tw-font-detail-lg disabled:tw-pointer-events-none focus-visible:tw-outline-none tw-border-[#006B86] tw-text-[#006B86] active:tw-bg-[#B3E7EB] disabled:tw-border-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-text-[#529BB0] hover:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] tw-h-10 tw-rounded-full tw-border-200 tw-p-spacing-400" href="/market-data/book-viewer">Learn More</a></div></div><div class="tw-relative tw-gap-spacing-200 tw-rounded-md tw-border-100 tw-p-spacing-600 tw-border-interface-brand-teal tw-bg-interface-common-base-01 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;svg]:tw-text-ink-common-base-04 tw-flex tw-grid-cols-1 tw-flex-col"><div class="tw-order-2 tw-mb-spacing-500 tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-gap-spacing-200"><h2 class="tw-mb-0 tw-font-subheading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary">Resources</h2></div><div class="tw-order-3 tw-mb-spacing-500 tw-font-body-md tw-text-ink-common-base-04 tw-flex-1"><p class="tw-mb-spacing-000">Read the explanatory booklet, Investing in Warrants, on what you need to know before investing.</p></div><div class="tw-order-last tw-flex tw-items-center tw-gap-spacing-400 tw-mt-auto"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="tw-inline-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-gap-1 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-text-center tw-font-medium tw-ring-offset-interface-common-base-01 tw-transition-colors tw-font-detail-lg disabled:tw-pointer-events-none focus-visible:tw-outline-none tw-border-[#006B86] tw-text-[#006B86] active:tw-bg-[#B3E7EB] disabled:tw-border-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-text-[#529BB0] hover:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] tw-h-10 tw-rounded-full tw-border-200 tw-p-spacing-400" href="https://cdn.cboe.com/resources/membership/AU_Guide_Investing_In_Warrants_V7.pdf">Discover</a></div></div></div></div></section><section data-section-background="default" class="tw-w-full tw-transition-colors tw-bg-interface-common-base-01 [&amp;:has(+section[data-section-background=&quot;default&quot;])&gt;div]:tw-pb-spacing-600 [&amp;:has(+section[data-section-background=&quot;transparent&quot;])&gt;div]:tw-pb-spacing-800 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;p]:tw-text-ink-common-base-04 [section[data-section-background=&quot;default&quot;]+&amp;&gt;div]:tw-pt-spacing-600"><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-max-w-screen-xl tw-px-spacing-600 tw-py-spacing-800"><h2 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-font-subheading-md tw-text-ink-brand-primary" data-heading-level="2">A Focus On Quality Markets</h2><p>There are 2 broad types of warrants.<!-- --> <span class="tw-font-bold">Trading style warrants</span> have features that better lend themselves to shorter term trading.<!-- --> <span class="tw-font-bold">Investment style warrants</span> are typically held for longer although they can also be traded actively.</p><div class="
            tw-mb-spacing-600 tw-grid tw-grid-cols-1
            lg:tw-grid-cols-3
            sm:tw-grid-cols-2
          "><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-h-64 tw-w-72"><hr class="tw-mb-spacing-400"/><h3 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-font-heading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary" data-heading-level="3">Underlying Asset</h3><p>All warrants have an underlying asset - it can be a security, a share price index or an instrument based on an index, a foreign exchange rate, a commodity or other asset.</p></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-h-64 tw-w-72"><hr class="tw-mb-spacing-400"/><h3 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-font-heading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary" data-heading-level="3">Trading Warrants</h3><p>Trading warrants are typically cash settled and investment style warrants are typically deliverable which means you have the right to purchase/sell the underlying asset.</p></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-h-64 tw-w-72"><hr class="tw-mb-spacing-400"/><h3 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-font-heading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary" data-heading-level="3">Expiration Date</h3><p>Some warrants have an expiry date which is the last day that a warrant can be exercised.</p></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-h-64 tw-w-72"><hr class="tw-mb-spacing-400"/><h3 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-font-heading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary" data-heading-level="3">Conversion Ratio</h3><p>Warrants have a conversion ratio which tells you how many warrants you must hold if you want to buy/sell the underlying by exercising your warrants.</p></div><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-h-64 tw-w-72"><hr class="tw-mb-spacing-400"/><h3 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-font-heading-sm tw-text-ink-brand-primary" data-heading-level="3">Foreign Exchange Rate</h3><p>Index warrants and warrants over commodities or foreign exchange rates have a contract multiplier which is used to calculate the value of the warrant. The multiplier may be denominated in a foreign currency.</p></div></div><p>To learn more about the benefits, risks and style of warrants, download our explanatory booklet,<!-- --> <a class="tw-group tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-sm tw-border-dashed tw-border-interface-common-base-01/0 tw-text-right tw-transition-colors focus-visible:tw-outline-none focus:tw-rounded-sm tw-inline tw-whitespace-normal tw-border-100 tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-detail-lg focus:tw-underline hover:tw-underline tw-text-ink-brand-primary focus:tw-border-interface-brand-primary-06" href="https://cdn.cboe.com/resources/membership/AU_Guide_Investing_In_Warrants_V7.pdf"><span class="">Investing in Warrants</span></a>.</p><p><span class="tw-font-bold">Issuer of Warrants</span><br/>Citigroup Global Markets Australia Pty Ltd<br/>1300 30 70 70<br/><a class="tw-group tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-sm tw-border-dashed tw-border-interface-common-base-01/0 tw-text-right tw-transition-colors focus-visible:tw-outline-none focus:tw-rounded-sm tw-inline tw-whitespace-normal tw-border-100 tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-detail-lg focus:tw-underline hover:tw-underline tw-text-ink-brand-primary focus:tw-border-interface-brand-primary-06" href="https://citifirst.com.au/"><span class="">citifirst.com.au</span></a><br/>Registry:<!-- --> <a class="tw-group tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-sm tw-border-dashed tw-border-interface-common-base-01/0 tw-text-right tw-transition-colors focus-visible:tw-outline-none focus:tw-rounded-sm tw-inline tw-whitespace-normal tw-border-100 tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-detail-lg focus:tw-underline hover:tw-underline tw-text-ink-brand-primary focus:tw-border-interface-brand-primary-06" href="http://www.computershare.com/au/Pages/default.aspx"><span class="">Computershare Australia</span></a><br/><a class="tw-group tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-sm tw-border-dashed tw-border-interface-common-base-01/0 tw-text-right tw-transition-colors focus-visible:tw-outline-none focus:tw-rounded-sm tw-inline tw-whitespace-normal tw-border-100 tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-detail-lg focus:tw-underline hover:tw-underline tw-text-ink-brand-primary focus:tw-border-interface-brand-primary-06" href="https://au.citifirst.com/EN/Publications/CitiFirstMarketOverview"><span class="">Subscribe to the Citi&#x27;s market overview</span></a></p><div role="alert" class="tw-relative tw-max-w-[815px] [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-absolute [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-left-7 [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-top-spacing-600 [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-h-5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:tw-w-5 [&amp;&gt;svg+div]:tw-translate-y-[-3px] [&amp;&gt;svg~*]:tw-pl-7 tw-mx-auto tw-mb-spacing-300 tw-mt-spacing-600 tw-w-full tw-rounded-md tw-bg-interface-brand-primary-06 tw-p-spacing-000"><div class="
