                tw-text-ink-common-inv-01
                sm:tw-mr-spacing-600 sm:tw-w-full sm:tw-text-left
              "><h3 class="tw-font-heading-sm tw-mb-spacing-200 tw-text-ink-common-inv-01" data-heading-level="3">Get in Touch</h3><p class="tw-font-body-sm">Reach out today and a member of our team will respond promptly.</p></div><a class="tw-w-32" href="/#contact"><button class="tw-inline-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-gap-1 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-text-center tw-font-medium tw-ring-offset-interface-common-base-01 tw-transition-colors tw-font-detail-lg disabled:tw-pointer-events-none focus-visible:tw-outline-none tw-border-interface-brand-teal tw-bg-interface-brand-teal tw-text-[#000000] active:tw-border-[#53C8D1] active:tw-bg-[#53C8D1] disabled:tw-border-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-bg-[#E4F8FE] disabled:tw-text-[#529BB0] hover:tw-border-[#79D4DB] hover:tw-bg-[#79D4DB] tw-h-10 tw-rounded-full tw-border-200 tw-p-spacing-400">Contact Us</button></a></div></div></div></section><section data-section-background="default" class="tw-w-full tw-transition-colors tw-bg-interface-common-base-01 [&amp;:has(+section[data-section-background=&quot;default&quot;])&gt;div]:tw-pb-spacing-600 [&amp;:has(+section[data-section-background=&quot;transparent&quot;])&gt;div]:tw-pb-spacing-800 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;p]:tw-text-ink-common-base-04 [section[data-section-background=&quot;default&quot;]+&amp;&gt;div]:tw-pt-spacing-600" id="faqs"><div class="tw-mx-auto tw-max-w-screen-xl tw-px-spacing-600 tw-py-spacing-800"><h2 class="tw-mb-spacing-400 tw-font-subheading-md tw-text-ink-brand-primary" data-heading-level="2">Warrants - FAQ</h2><div class="" data-variant="default" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" class="tw-border-b-100 tw-border-interface-common-base-04"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="tw-mb-0 tw-flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_R_26alubsnqbrlb_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_6alubsnqbrlb_" class="tw-px-spacing-200 tw-text-left tw-text-ink-