ly, the Issuer of the warrant series will have the relevant PDS on their website. You can find links to Issuer websites in our Issuer details section.\"}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"Where can I buy or sell warrants?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"You can buy or sell warrants through brokers who are TMX Australia Exchange trading participants. A list of TMX Australia Exchange trading participants can be viewed\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"className\":\"tw-group tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-sm tw-border-dashed tw-border-interface-common-base-01/0 tw-text-right tw-transition-colors focus-visible:tw-outline-none focus:tw-rounded-sm tw-inline tw-whitespace-normal tw-border-100 tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-detail-lg focus:tw-underline hover:tw-underline tw-text-ink-brand-primary focus:tw-border-interface-brand-primary-06\",\"href\":\"/equities/trading/trading-participants\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[false,\"here\",false,false]}]}],\".\"]}]}]]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"Can I trade TMX Australia Exchange warrants through any broker?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"You can trade TMX Australia Exchange quoted warrants through brokers who are TMX Australia Exchange trading participants. A list of TMX Australia Exchange trading participants can be viewed\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"className\":\"tw-group tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-rounded-sm tw-border-dashed tw-border-interface-common-base-01/0 tw-text-right tw-transition-colors focus-visible:tw-outline-none focus:tw-rounded-sm tw-inline tw-whitespace-normal tw-border-100 tw-underline tw-underline-offset-2 tw-font-detail-lg focus:tw-underline hover:tw-underline tw-text-ink-brand-primary focus:tw-border-interface-brand-primary-06\",\"href\":\"/equities/trading/trading-participants\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[false,\"here\",false,false]}]}],\".\"]}]}]]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"What is the difference between warrants traded on TMX Australia Exchange and warrants traded on ASX?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Trading and settlement of warrants is very similar on both markets. Settlement will go through CHESS and the warrants are on the register used by the Issuer irrespective of which market the warrants are traded on.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The warrants being traded on each market are different. There might be the same type of warrants for example instalments, MINIs etc., some of the Issuers might be the same and the underlying instruments may be the same but the actual warrant series will be different.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Importantly, each series will have its own market - bids and offers and volume.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"TMX Australia Exchange anticipates that over time, there will be more and more warrants being quoted on its market.\"}]]}]]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row7\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"How do I know if a warrant is traded on TMX Australia Exchange or on ASX?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Check the Symbol against the list in our Reference Data section to see if the warrant is quoted at TMX Australia Exchange.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Some issuers have different 5th letter symbols on TMX Australia Exchange. Citiwarrants (CTW) uses \\\"C\\\" as the 5th letter on TMX Australia Exchange and \\\"O\\\" at ASX. Other issuers use the same letter on both exchanges.\"}]]}]]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"If I buy a warrant on ASX can I sell it on TMX Australia Exchange and vice versa?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"No, you can't. Warrants quoted and traded by TMX Australia Exchange are exclusively traded on TMX Australia Exchange. The same applies to ASX quoted warrants. The simple rule "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"is you have to sell on the market that you bought on.\"}]}]]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row9\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"What must I do before I can trade warrants on TMX Australia Exchange?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You will need to have signed a client agreement with your broker and been provided with the TMX Australia Exchange explanatory booklet.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"However if you have already been approved for trading ASX warrants, that approval applies to TMX Australia Exchange warrants. You do not need to sign another client agreement.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"All retail clients need to be provided with a copy of the TMX Australia Exchange Explanatory Booklet prior to trading. A wholesale client must be provided with a copy of the TMX Australia Exchange Explanatory Booklet if it is requested.\"}]]}]]}]\n44:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"Where do I find a client agreement?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Each broker has its own client agreement. You should ask your broker for a copy.\"}]}]]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row11\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"How do I find the key terms of a warrant?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The reference data section has some terms about each warrant, such as Expiry date, Strike price and type of warrant. This page has links to more detailed reference data, and to the PDS.\"}]}]]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"What if I want to buy more warrants than are shown on the market?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The volume visible on screen is not necessarily reflective of the total volume available to buy and sell at a price. This is because Issuers act as, or contract the services of, market makers to provide liquidity. The arrangements between issuers and market makers require liquidity to be maintained so that investors can have confidence that, barring an extraordinary event, reasonable prices may be available for the purpose of liquidating existing positions.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"If you want to trade in larger volumes, you should speak to your broker or contact the Issuer of the relevant warrant series.\"}]]}]]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row13\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"If I am trading for myself do I need to sign a client agreement?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Yes, you will still need to have signed a client agreement with your broker and been provided with the TMX Australia Exchange explanatory booklet.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"However if you have already been approved for trading ASX warrants, that approval applies to TMX Australia Exchange warrants. You do not need to sign another client agreement.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"All retail clients need to be provided with a copy of the TMX Australia Exchange Explanatory Booklet prior to trading. A wholesale client must be provided with a copy of the TMX Australia Exchange Explanatory Booklet if it is requested.\"}]]}]]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row14\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"Does my advisor need to be accredited if advising me on warrants?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"If you are receiving advice, on investing in warrants, by an adviser employed by a TMX Australia Exchange Trading Participant, then your adviser must be accredited before they can advise you on TMX Australia Exchange traded warrants.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Your adviser must, at a minimum, have accreditation as an Accredited Derivatives Adviser level 1 (also known as ADA1), in order to provide advice on subscribing for, buying, selling and exercising warrants. Advisers with a level 2 accreditation (ADA2) can additionally provide advice on all trading strategies relating to warrants.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"For other advisers, different types of accreditation are available.\"}]]}]]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"]\n49:[\"$\",\"$L3a\",null,{\"value\":\"row15\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"children\":\"Why can't I see a TMX Australia Exchange traded warrant on my market screen?\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Not all brokers are TMX Australia Exchange trading participants. The list of TMX Australia Exchange trading participants can be found in the Trading section of our website which can be accessed form the homepage.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"TMX Australia Exchange trading participants are transitioning in their readiness to offer markets in TMX Australia Exchange warrants. You should ask your broker when they will be ready.\"}]]}]]}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"className\":\"tw-flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"tw-mb-spacing-000\",\"children\":\"CitiFirst investments in Australia cover a broad selection of quoted warrants, structured products and funds.\"}]}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"tw-inline-flex tw-items-center tw-justify-center tw-gap-1 tw-whitespace-nowrap tw-text-center tw-font-medium tw-ring-offset-interface-common-base-01 tw-transition-co